# Committed build outputs (firmware + host binaries + slot apps).
#
# The repo-root .gitignore ignores *.uf2 globally; re-include ONLY the firmware
# image below. User content is NOT committed here: the boot animation and the
# ANIMATION keyframe UF2s stay local (tools/builds/ or flash partitions).
!firmware/ydkb_athena75_rgb_advanced_vial.uf2

# Slot apps (src/app/.gitignore ignores *.app under src/app/<name>/).
!apps/
!apps/*.app

# Local-only apps: ACE embeds the keyframe QGF built from private PNGs.
apps/hidden/

# athena_sim binaries (tools/build_sim.sh writes sim/<os>/). Committed like
# host_tool: SDL2 is linked statically, so the only remaining dependencies are
# OS frameworks and the binary runs on a machine with no SDL2 installed.
!sim/
!sim/*/athena_sim
!sim/*/athena_sim.exe
!sim/*/athena_sim_cli
!sim/*/athena_sim_cli.exe
!sim/readme.txt

# SDL2 ships no static library in its MSVC package, so a Windows window build
# needs this DLL beside the exe. Third-party binary: keep it local.
sim/*/SDL2.dll
